{
  "original": "小心滑入河中",
  "reference_notes": {
    "小心的隐性否定": "识别'小心'暗含'不要'的否定意义。",
    "警告语气": "保留警告/提醒的语气。",
    "动作完整性": "保留'滑入河中'的完整动作。"
  },
  "translation": "Carefully I slide into the river,\nMy throat chokes, unable to sing; tears flow without words.\nDo not wait until flowers fall to cherish spring,\nFor the hills wish to keep the guest, the wind knocks at the door."
}
